### Feature Client — GET ALL / GET ONE
### SIN AUTH (Fase I — Business)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

### GET ALL — solo clientes activos
# @name getAllClients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes

### GET ONE — 404 si no existe o está inactivo
# @name getOneClient
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{id}}

### 400 — :id no numérico
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/abc
